Bound and reuse decoded GS texture storage without player configuration.
Evict least-recently-used uploads before exceeding 128 MiB; preserve the active texture.
Update existing same-shape storage rather than redefining it after content invalidation.
The budget excludes render targets, replacement packs and driver staging allocations.
Validation: verify passed; production-policy stress and real CT32/T8/T4 GPU reuploads passed.
Xeon/RX 580: 58.94 -> 59.51 guest FPS (+0.97%, 3/3 alternating pairs); not locked 60.
Intel UHD memory-pressure scene and NVIDIA remain unvalidated.

